    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should see a doctor but i really don't have the time right now and my insurance is a nightmare. it's really just a burning sensation, not like a crushing pain or anything. it feels exactly like the indigestion i get after a big meal. honestly, it's probably just acid reflux from my diet. can you just tell me if taking a higher dose of Pepcid would be okay for now? i just want to manage this at home until things settle down.",
